use firn/tags

poppler-utils is a Module
poppler-utils is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  option myConfig.modules.poppler-utils.enable: enable "Poppler PDF rendering and text extraction tools"
  config when config.myConfig.modules.poppler-utils.enable
    environment.systemPackages: with pkgs: [poppler-utils]
